{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"screen\": \"我到底在气谁 又在想谁\",\n      \"source\": \"心里明明有东西，却还分不清这份不平静究竟是愤怒、遗憾还是怀念——这是一种尚未找到对象、也尚未找到语言的失落。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"把尚未找到对象的情绪具体改成针对某个“谁”的愤怒和思念，额外加入了人际对象这一限定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"screen\": \"活动感像暂时侧身离开沉重的问题，出去走走、聊点别的；那一刻的轻松是真的，却没带来答案。昂扬退潮后，又忍不住问：刚才是真的相信，还是只在努力相信\",\n      \"source\": \"这股活动感也可以听成一次短暂的侧身离场：不再正面迎着那个沉重的问题，像是聊点别的，或出去走走，让注意力暂时离开伤口。那一刻的轻松可以是真的，并非假装；只是它没有替心里的事找到答案。也可以听成：如果换一种感受，这里不像重新获得活力，更像前一段的昂扬正在慢慢退潮。音乐变得流动、含蓄、若有所思，仿佛心里冒出一句自问：我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿将暂时侧身离场和昂扬退潮作为两种听法，屏幕稿却用“后”将它们接成了先后发生的一段过程。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"歌声、舞步只剩轻弱断续的碎片；哄睡的歌也在暗淡忧郁中破碎重现\",\n      \"source\": \"它们既像先前如歌旋律的碎片，也像那些舞曲主题的残片；另一种更凄厉哀婉的听法，是听见先前那段摇篮曲破碎地重现，只是这次变成了F小调。\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确将摇篮曲破碎重现标为另一种听法，屏幕稿用“也”将它写成前述歌声、舞步碎片之外同时出现的另一层。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e18fb6a8-e8df-4089-aaaf-445000619bbd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T014147692369Z", "elapsed_seconds": 163.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T01:44:31.282621+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d8ac9068b112ad4a61cebdd83ee0694423130093c2533dedd3a5f36d70b92965", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T014147692369Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "cabafb92cef0b25bb3a18c663e52697bbf4477d2b72a2b6559aa03057a5eafec"}}}
